 value function $V_\phi (s)$ or action-value function $Q_\phi (s,a)$. The tempo
ral difference error computed from the critic's estimates provides a low-varian
ce learning signal for updating the actor's policy parameters. This architectur
e combines the stability benefits of value-based methods with the flexibility o
f policy gradient approaches.}}{24}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }

