[104
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.5}{\ignorespaces Evoluti
on of localization loss functions in object detection. IoU loss directly optimi
zes box overlap but provides zero gradients for non-overlapping boxes. GIoU add
resses this by penalizing empty space within the enclosing box $C$. DIoU explic
itly minimizes center point distance $\rho $ normalized by the diagonal $c$ of 
the enclosing box. CIoU further adds an aspect ratio consistency term $\alpha v
$ to encourage matching box shapes. Distribution Focal Loss (DFL) reformulates 
coordinate regression as classification over discretized bins, naturally modeli
ng localization uncertainty. Modern YOLO architectures combine CIoU with DFL fo
r robust localization learning.}}{104}{figure.caption.52}\protected@file@percen
t }
\newlabel{fig:iou_losses}{{5.5}{104}{Evolution of localization loss functions i
n object detection. IoU loss directly optimizes box overlap but provides zero g
radients for non-overlapping boxes. GIoU addresses this by penalizing empty spa
ce within the enclosing box $C$. DIoU explicitly minimizes center point distanc
e $\rho $ normalized by the diagonal $c$ of the enclosing box. CIoU further add
s an aspect ratio consistency term $\alpha v$ to encourage matching box shapes.
 Distribution Focal Loss (DFL) reformulates coordinate regression as classifica
tion over discretized bins, naturally modeling localization uncertainty. Modern
 YOLO architectures combine CIoU with DFL for robust localization learning}{fig
ure.caption.52}{}}
\newlabel{fig:iou_losses@cref}{{[figure][5][5]5.5}{[1][103][]104}{}{}{}}
